<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University. The BAS in medical laboratory sciences is offered through a partnership with Phoenix College in which the student completes 90 credits in an Associate in Applied Science degree at Phoenix College, then completes 30 credits through ASU.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Only students who have been admitted through Phoenix College and been approved by the program director are accepted for adm</font></div><div><font face="arial">ission to this program. For acceptance into the medical laboratory science program, please review the <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwebapp4.asu.edu%2Fprograms%2Ft5%2Fmajorinfo%2FASU00%2FNUMLSBAS%2Fundergrad%2Ffalse&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNGaEn5aAr8a4uXTkK6uLcRufTSIZQ">additional requirements</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please see an advisor on the Phoenix College campus or ASU’s Downtown Phoenix campus to learn more about this program. You can also contact the ASU medical laboratory science program director, Jeff Wolz, directly at <a href="jwolz@asu.edu">jwolz@asu.edu</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fcatalog.asu.edu%2F%2Fsites%2Fdefault%2Ffiles%2Fimports%2FMDL%2520Course%2520Sequence%252012-13.pdf&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNHjn4pLUcxBKMkKmgTFXzWbxkdLhw">View the pathway</a> for this program.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>